<title>BELGIUM: Telinfo sees 20 pct 1997 profit rise.</title>
<headline>Telinfo sees 20 pct 1997 profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LEUVEN, Belgium 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian data communications company Telinfo NV said on Friday it expected a rise in 1997 group pre-tax profit of about 20 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;I foresee growth of about 20 percent -- group pre-tax profit -- and of 17 percent in turnover,&quot; chairman John Cordier told a news conference on 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>The company's 1996 group net profit soared 74 percent to 221 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
